          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "For overa century, <strong>Bhima Jewellery</strong> has been a trusted name in purity,craftsmanship, and timeless design. Established in 1925, Bhima pioneered thejewellery retail revolution in South India with a simple promise — <strong>uncompromisingauthenticity and transparent pricing</strong>.Today, as we celebrate <strong>101 years of legacy</strong>,Bhima continues to craft jewellery that blends tradition, innovation, andemotion. Every piece reflects the artistry of master craftsmen, the heritage ofIndian culture, and the trust of millions of customers across generations",
